        "requirement": "A single hex base",
        "status": "partial",
        "evidence": "There is one 3-storey north half base (piece:0,0,0;half-n, fused across levels 0-2) at q0 r0, in place of the starting full base, which can't take drawers. It's tall and a half base, so it isn't a single-storey full hex."
